      "id": "f-zen-http-request-2318c2",
      "name": "FZenHttpRequest",
      "category": "ZenServerHttp",
      "signature": "FZenHttpRequest(In Domain, In Log Errors, Connect Timeout MS)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "In Domain",
          "type": "FStringView"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Log Errors",
          "type": "Bool"
        },
        {
          "name": "Connect Timeout MS",
          "type": "uint32_t",
          "default": "0"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Minimal HTTP request type wrapping CURL without the need for managers. This request\nis written to allow reuse of request objects, in order to allow connections to be reused.\nCURL has a global library initialization (curl_global_init). We rely on this happening in\nthe Online/HTTP library which is a dependency of this module"
